BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 480.39 Td (First ten minutes: the eleven items. For each one, actually fetch the thing. Not "we have that" but the document,) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 465.89 Td (on the table. Grade it Ready, Question or Gap while it is in your hand.) Tj ET
