BT 0.42 0.45 0.44 rg /F1 7 Tf 525.1 30 Td (Page 5) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 58 777.89 Td (worked in a care role, anywhere, drives the regulation 32 clock for the level 3. One date cannot do both jobs.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 58 758.39 Td (Two agency counts. Times means shifts: the same person on ten nights is ten. Different members means) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 58 743.89 Td (people: that same person is one. Spell each name the same way every time.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 58 724.39 Td (A counting date. Every count runs from the last full inspection up to today, or a date you type, so a shift, start) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 58 709.89 Td (or leaving date in the future is not counted.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 690.39 Td (On the level 3 clock: regulation 32\(5\) puts the relevant date two years after first starting in a care role, and 32\(6\) lets) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 675.89 Td (the registered person defer it for part-time work or a prolonged absence. That deferral is a decision to record, not) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 661.39 Td (automatic, so the Staff list has a column for it. For the 34.1 count, the form's own guidance suggests counting part-time) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 9.5 Tf 48 646.89 Td (staff only after five years; the workbook follows the form for the count and the regulation for each person's Status.) Tj ET
BT 0.42 0.45 0.44 rg /F1 9 Tf 48 627.39 Td (The question numbers are the form's as updated 1 April 2026. Always check the wording against the copy Ofsted sends you.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 15 Tf 48 593.89 Td (The new law, in plain English) Tj ET
0.75 0.8 0.78 RG 0.6 w 48 587.89 m 547.28 587.89 l S
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 565.89 Td (The Children's Wellbeing and Schools Act 2026 received Royal Assent on 29 April 2026. The headlines were) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 551.39 Td (about the biggest providers. The practical changes for a home's paperwork are quieter and worth knowing.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 531.89 Td (There is more financial oversight, especially of larger providers. There is more attention on provider groups as a) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 517.39 Td (whole, not just single homes. And there is a clear direction of travel: be able to show where the money goes and) Tj ET
